OL,3,GNEWSASly visitor outfoxes security to
OL,4,Areach MP's office
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cunning fox managed to outwit
OL,7,Fsecurity and find its way to an MP's
OL,8,Foffice on the fourth floor of a
OL,9,FWestminster building.
OL,11,FThe furry visitor was discovered inside
OL,12,Fthe office of George Freeman,
OL,13,FConservative MP for Mid Norfolk, in
OL,14,FPortcullis House on Monday morning.
OL,16,FTo reach the room, the adventurous
OL,17,Fanimal had to sneak past security,
OL,18,Fnavigate four flights of stairs and a
OL,19,F"maize of rooms and corridors".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
