OL,3,GNEWSASly visitor outfoxes security to
OL,4,Areach MP's office
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fox has since been relocated to
OL,7,FVictoria Tower Gardens, a public park
OL,8,Fnearby. Freeman said: "His dedication
OL,9,Fto the morning commute is highly
OL,10,Fimpressive."
